      "writtenOn": "2023-10-27T16:08:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you think there would be any other prints happening during this extended read operation? I know there are some issues with cprint re-entrancy in platform/ec codebase.\n\nI think the work around of only delivering 32 makes sense at least for now. Can you add comments of why you are doing this limiting and that we might be able to remove it in the future if buffered gets more robust.\n\n\n---\n\nAlso are you sure the issues is on the hyper debug UART output side instead of input buffering on the devboardservice side?",
      "parentUuid": "e805f134_dee24242",
      "revId": "5827f8e4e94baadb0c856696b84383a520d70f9e",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
